      "body": "GDPR applies equally to websites, mobile apps and desktop applications. For an up-to-date analysis, I found these to be informative: \r\n\r\n- [https://www.kevel.co/blog/gdpr-google-analytics/](https://www.kevel.co/blog/gdpr-google-analytics/)\r\n- [https://www.mobiloud.com/blog/gdpr-compliant-mobile-app](https://www.mobiloud.com/blog/gdpr-compliant-mobile-app)",
